title: Chronicle
oneLiner: Story journal — records every NPC conversation: gossip, quest text, and spoken lines.
icon: icon.png

---

Talking to an NPC writes the conversation into a journal, grouped by that NPC: gossip, quest text, and lines they speak. Quest rewards are recorded with the conversation, and reward items can be hovered and clicked like item links in chat. The newest line in a conversation is at the top.

`/ch` opens the journal.
